.TH "LLVM-STRESS" "1" "2026-07-15" "22" "LLVM"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
llvm-stress \- generate random .ll files
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.sp
\fBllvm\-stress\fP [\-size=filesize] [\-seed=initialseed] [\-o=outfile]
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.sp
The \fBllvm\-stress\fP tool is used to generate random \fB\&.ll\fP files that
can be used to test different components of LLVM.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-o filename
Specify the output filename.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-size size
Specify the size of the generated \fB\&.ll\fP file.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-seed seed
Specify the seed to be used for the randomly generated instructions.
.UNINDENT
.SH "وضعیت خروج (EXIT STATUS)"
.sp
\fBllvm\-stress\fP returns 0.
.SH "نویسنده (AUTHOR)"
Maintained by the LLVM Team (https://llvm.org/).
.SH "حق نشر (COPYRIGHT)"
2003-2026, LLVM Project
